How to play:
Game rules
One type of suit can sit atop of the other card or the same card name; e.g. If A-spade is atop,a card with A or spade can be played.
8 can be played atop of any card except if the user is hit and is used to change the suit.
Joker can be played atop of any card and can be used to change the suit or hit.
In a beginning of a game, any card can be played
Joker or 7 must be followed by another card
If a user is hit by 2, they should pick 2 cards from the dustbin
if a user is hit by joker, they should pik 4 cards
If the first user is hit by 2, and then they hit back by joker, the other user will have to pick (2 + 4) cards from the dustbin or hit back.


Definition of key words:
"Dustbin" - cards that can be picked,
"Pick" - take a card from the dustbin
"Requested to play or pick" - Should play any card based on the game rules or pick a card from the dustbin
"Hit" - If hit, should hit back (if they want to) with a 2 or Joker, or request to pick the specified number of cards from the dustbin.


aim of the game: To play all the provided cards and finish before everyone else.


